  "description": "You’ve been stuck in this dull cell for too long—time to swap boredom for freedom. Pull back the rug, grab whatever you can find (yes, even a spoon), and start digging your way to daylight. Keep an eye on the guard, bribe him with the junk you unearth, and trade toilet paper with your fellow inmates for better tools.\n\nHide the dirt in the toilet, cover the tunnel when inspections roll around, and keep upgrading your gear—stronger shovels, bigger backpacks, glow sticks, even dynamite. The deeper you dig, the closer you get to freedom… and the riskier things become.\n\nExercise to boost your stamina, hustle for food to keep your strength up, and follow cryptic letters that hint at the right direction. One mistake could land you back at square one—or worse.\n\nAre you clever, cautious, and desperate enough to outwit the system? The tunnel’s waiting—start digging before the guard notices.",
